      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where does the dummy file live? Wouldn\u0027t we also need logic in ec Makefiles to copy installed /build/${BOARD}/.../ec_config.c to the WORKDIR where EC sources are compiled? If using emerge then it will have to be copied to somewhere under /build/${BOARD}/tmp/.../ whereas if using make then ec_config.c will have to be copied to EC directory i.e. ~/trunk/src/platform/ec/... Also, for make, if ec_config.c is not already installed then it can default to the dummy one as Jett indicated.\n\nThe other way to potentially do this is to enforce adding of ec_config.c manually as a CL any time model.yaml is updated. But, it is error prone(manual effort) since it requires synchronized updates across different repos.",
